      "fine_trace_step": 9,
      "description": "Root cause. `tt_size_reset` performs a TrueType-only field write before any CFF2 early return. For the CFF2 face traced here, `size` actually aliases the smaller `CFF_SizeRec` allocated in `FT_New_Size`, so the missing `if ( face->isCFF2 ) return FT_Err_Ok;` guard added by the fix is the obligation that would have prevented the overflow."
